	column geo = ```
			
			var temp = LOOKUPVALUE('public v_dim_pbiworkspaces'[geo_raw],'public v_dim_pbiworkspaces'[workspaceid],'public v_dim_pbireport'[workspaceid])
			VAR geo = IF(
			    temp = "NA" ||
			    temp = "PRC" ||
			    temp = "EMEA" ||
			    temp = "AP" ||
			    temp = "LA" ||
			    temp = BLANK(),
			    temp,
			    "No Record"
			)
			RETURN geo
			
			```
		lineageTag: 61861c53-04bf-4081-9f24-6f24f4baf75f
		summarizeBy: none

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

